sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DB as cyclotron_jobs
    participant P1 as Pod 1 (stuck event loop)
    participant P2 as Pod 2..n (healthy)
    participant Jan as Janitor
    participant K8s as Liveness probe
    P1->>DB: dequeued rows, now running, heartbeat stops
    Note over P1: both loops share the event loop, both stop
    P2->>DB: keep dequeuing priority 0 first, from both loops
    Note over P2: new fast rows go to healthy pods, unaffected
    Jan->>DB: rows of P1 past the heartbeat timeout back to available
    P2->>DB: dequeue the recovered rows (a send P1 already handed to SES can repeat)
    K8s->>P1: isHealthy fails per loop (lastPollTime per lane), restart
